meta {
  name: BillXpress Vendor Public API
  type: collection
  version: 1
}

docs {
  # BillXpress Vendor Public API

  This is the separate public-facing API documentation collection for approved BillXpress vendors.

  The raw HTML documentation lives at:

  ```txt
  Vendor API documentation/index.html
  ```

  ## Base URL

  Production:

  ```txt
  https://billxpressbackend-production.up.railway.app
  ```

  Vendor route prefix:

  ```txt
  /api/v1/vendor
  ```

  ## Authentication

  Vendor requests use API-key auth:

  ```txt
  Authorization: {{vendorApiKey}}
  ```

  Do not prefix vendor API keys with `Bearer`.

  ## Rate Limit

  Vendor API routes currently allow `120 requests per minute` per endpoint/IP.

  When exceeded, the API returns:

  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Too many vendor API requests, please try again shortly",
    "code": "RATE_LIMITED",
    "retryAfterSeconds": 30
  }
  ```

  ## Planned Vendor Resources

  ```txt
  GET  /api/v1/vendor/me
  GET  /api/v1/vendor/wallet
  GET  /api/v1/vendor/transactions
  GET  /api/v1/vendor/data/plans
  POST /api/v1/vendor/data/purchase
  GET  /api/v1/vendor/data/purchase/:reference
  GET  /api/v1/vendor/airtime/networks
  POST /api/v1/vendor/airtime/quote
  POST /api/v1/vendor/airtime/purchase
  GET  /api/v1/vendor/social-growth/services
  POST /api/v1/vendor/social-growth/quote
  POST /api/v1/vendor/social-growth/orders
  GET  /api/v1/vendor/social-growth/orders/:orderId
  ```
}
